  just too many to name but um  you know all of empire strikes back  looks the the photography in that film  the feeling of that movie was just so it  was so beautifully  made  um  like i said they're just there are too  many moments that i appreciate  especially now working  as a director on these films  i've i've come to see how easy they made  it look  uh when it really is not easy at all  [Music]  kevin feige needs no advice for me i  mean he's he's  doing uh obviously uh incredible work so  i cannot wait to see what what he does  and what all the filmmakers do with  kathy  it's a great question  it can be  a line of dialogue it can be a shot it  can be  costume design it could be a creature  design ship design  everything sort of goes through  this same filter which i'm sure  is maybe different for everyone or or at  least you know  various people have their own opinions  but there is something that feels like  oh that's that feels like star wars and  that doesn't feel like star wars and  it's a bit like you know when you see it  you can't  tell you can't like create a  a list of criteria and say this is what  makes something star wars this is what  makes it not star wars um  except for maybe shoes someone mentioned  that they don't have laces and that  there are no buttons i'm like well  that's probably true but in terms of of  something that feels like star wars or  not uh it's a strange  gut feeling and it's not to say that  anyone's right but it's like everyone  has their own sense of what that is  [Music]  i'm definitely you know  curious what people think and i'm aware  of you know what  fans are generally thinking and and  saying though i'm sure i'm missing  a huge amount at all times but i you  know i'm i'd like to think i'm generally  aware  you take that into consideration just  the way you take into consideration  things that you know  friends of yours say and people you  trust you know family who are honest  about what's going on articles are being 